九。娶琅邪王士瑋女。次女和，字韶音，年十七，適潁川許昌陳敬祖三日婦。次女恭，字惠音，年十四，適弘農楊士產拜時。晚生二女皆不育。","person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p002:m0002"}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","interpretation_note":"原文所報年齡；不據報齡倒推生年或推定生母。","unit":"source_age_years"},{"id":"age-epxun-008","person_id":"zy1_o93_hgz","value":54,"source_number":"五十四","source_term":"年五十四","unit":"source_age_years","counting":"unspecified_source_age","birth_year":null,"age_context":{"kind":"at_death","life_event_id":"le-epxun-wife-death"},"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-epitaph-xunyue","book_id":"b-epitaph-xunyue-full","source_id":"s-epitaph-xunyue-chnmus","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003","quote":"夫人劉氏，年五十四，字簡訓。永安元年歲在甲子三月十六日癸丑卒於司徒府。乙卯殯。其年多故，四月十八日乙酉附葬。","person_mention_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"墓誌於死亡記載明報年五十四；同誌另記荀岳卒時夫人年卌五，兩個來源時點均保留，不據此倒推生年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p002:m0002","start":284,"end":285,"surface":"劉","kind":"person","person_id":"zy1_o93_hgz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"與右側夫人劉氏、字簡訓者同一，未載本名。","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p002","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full"},{"id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003:m0001","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"劉氏","kind":"person","person_id":"zy1_o93_hgz","status":"source_explicit","interpretation_note":"右側夫人記名劉氏，字簡訓。","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full"},{"id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003:m0002","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"簡訓","kind":"person","person_id":"zy1_o93_hgz","status":"source_explicit","interpretation_note":"墓誌明言劉氏字簡訓；未載本名。","paragraph_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full:p003","chapter_id":"c-epitaph-xunyue-museum-full"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-epxun-family-007","subject_person_id":"696_456_df6_BAA","predicate":"spouse","object_per